// # Seven println string statements
//
// Logline: Print seven string literals so emit-wasm can plant all seven texts.
//
// Setup: One public main. Body is only seven println(STRING) statements.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Print line-a through line-d.
//   2. Print line-e through line-g.
//   3. Leave no other statements.

pub fn main() {
    println("line-a");
    println("line-b");
    println("line-c");
    println("line-d");
    println("line-e");
    println("line-f");
    println("line-g");
}
